WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:04.590
Syun burns with fury at the Tyler sisters,

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.820
who destroyed the Spade Branch.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.460
But in a tag-team battle 
with Yuya, against them...

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:19.160
I really thought it was amazing.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:21.240
Seeing a duel like that...

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:28.630
We haven't seen one like that since we were 
at peace, when Yuya's father showed us.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.310
The Aquaria Project.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:38.080
In their plan to create an ideal world, 
the Fusion Dimension's Academia

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:43.370
has driven Heartland City, in the Xyz 
Dimension, to the brink of obliteration.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:21.990
The Falcon That Falls on the Battlefield

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.930
Are you okay, Allen? Sayaka?

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:34.360
A-Admittedly, your entertainment 
duel is really something...

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:37.170
But that doesn't mean that I 
acknowledge you as an ally.

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:40.350
Be honest, Allen.

00:02:40.350 --> 00:02:43.510
You've already acknowledged 
it in your mind...

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:46.380
That Yuya Sakaki is one of us.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.480
I... I know that.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:50.460
Allen...

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:57.910
Yeah.

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:07.530
Syun...

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:11.900
Now, we're all allies!

00:03:21.460 --> 00:03:23.720
Are your farewells finished?

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:27.230
Then, your affairs are in order?

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:30.040
You can all become cards without a fuss.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:33.090
At the hands of the Obelisk Force!

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:37.050
There are six of us and three of you.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:38.700
Go ahead and try us!

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:41.070
You're no match for them.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.120
Stand back.

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.560
We'll fight with you!

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:44.640
Let's do it!

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:47.180
You're injured. Don't strain yourselves.

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:48.600
Kurosaki and I will do it.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:51.640
Just two of you?

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:54.780
Two of us are enough to handle you.

00:03:55.430 --> 00:03:56.620
Such nonsense.

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:58.780
It doesn't matter how many there are.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:01.390
We'll finish off all of the Lancers.

00:04:01.820 --> 00:04:05.530
He sent not only us, but the Obelisk Force, too?

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:08.760
Manoro works quickly.

00:04:09.050 --> 00:04:12.480
My name is Mamoru Noro! Not "Manoro"!

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.730
And I wasn't the one who 
sent the Obelisk Force.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:19.470
The Professor must have predicted 
that this would happen.

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:21.500
Even that we'd lose?

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.280
Well, we did.

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:26.440
Hey, Grace... Doesn't it frustrate you?

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:28.330
Sure, but...

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.720
The duel was fun, so I guess I don't mind.

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:34.820
And that Yuya boy...

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:39.920
I want to see the entertainment duel he 
can show us against the Obelisk Force.

00:04:40.900 --> 00:04:41.890
I can't wait.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:45.980
I don't think your entertainment 
will get through to them.

00:04:45.980 --> 00:04:48.810
Even so, I need to go forward with my duel,

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:50.900
the duel my father fought.

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.620
Then do it, without regret.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:57.010
I'll go forward with my duel, too.

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.750
Field Spell Crossover.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:07.870
Duel!

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:09.870
I take the first turn!

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:13.270
I activate my spell card 
Polymerization from my hand.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:16.900
And I fuse two Ancient Gear 
Hunting Hounds in my hand!

00:05:17.310 --> 00:05:21.560
Mechanical hunting dogs who 
inherit the souls of antiquity,

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:25.870
snap at each other and be 
reborn with new power!

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.340
Fusion Summon!

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:32.440
Appear, Level 5 Double Ancient 
Gear Hunting Hound!

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.680
I now end my turn.

00:05:36.090 --> 00:05:37.420
My turn!

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:41.250
I summon Raidraptor — Vanishing 
Lanius from my hand.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:47.800
When I succeed in summoning or 
Special Summoning this card,

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:51.730
I can Special Summon another 
Vanishing Lanius from my hand.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:59.500
And using the second one's monster 
effect, I Special Summon another.

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:06.080
I overlay the three Level 4 
Vanishing Laniuses on the field!

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:11.590
Xyz Summon!

00:06:11.590 --> 00:06:17.260
Appear, Rank 4 Raidraptor — Rise Falcon!

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:23.960
In that instant, I activate Double Ancient 
Gear Hunting Hound's effect!

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:28.620
Once per turn, it can put a gear acid 
counter on a monster summoned

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.290
or Special Summoned to your field!

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:37.040
I use one of Rise Falcon's Overlay 
Units to activate its effect!

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:43.150
I add Double Ancient Gear Hunting Hound's 
1400 attack points to its own.

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:45.380
Battle, Rise Falcon!

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:48.600
Double Ancient Gear Hunting 
Hound's effect activates.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:53.690
A monster with a gear acid counter is 
destroyed before damage calculation!

00:06:53.690 --> 00:06:57.670
Quick-Play Spell Rank-Up-Magic Raptor's Force!

00:06:57.670 --> 00:07:02.300
The Rise Falcon that was just destroyed is 
Special Summoned from my graveyard.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:09.430
And I use it as a component to Xyz 
Summon a monster of one rank higher!

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:12.720
Rank-Up Xyz Change.

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:18.350
Appear, Rank 5 Raidraptor — Blaze Falcon!

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:22.140
Blaze Falcon can attack you directly.

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:23.090
Go!

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:31.900
In that instant, I activate Blaze Falcon's effect!

00:07:31.900 --> 00:07:37.700
When I deal battle damage to you, 
I can destroy one of your monsters.

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:45.500
I set one card and end my turn.

00:07:46.640 --> 00:07:48.090
That's the Syun I know!

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:50.430
He predicted everything his 
opponent was going to do!

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:52.940
Yeah, a splendid fighting style.

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:55.750
The Obelisk Force members 
aren't much, are they?

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:58.810
Strange... According to my calculations,

00:07:58.810 --> 00:08:01.920
they should have beaten both 
of them within five minutes...

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:04.500
Maybe we should get back in there.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.090
Patience.

00:08:06.090 --> 00:08:08.750
The Obelisk Force won't be defeated that easily.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:10.600
Y-Yeah, but...

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:12.240
Just watch over them for now.

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:15.380
Now, once more,

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:18.120
let me see the ultimate show!

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:20.160
My turn!

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:23.820
I activate my spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:27.790
I fuse three Ancient Gear Hunting 
Hounds in my hand.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:29.250
Fusion Summon!

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:35.180
Appear, Level 7 Triple Ancient 
Gear Hunting Hound!

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:41.230
And I activate spell card Ancient Gear 
Double Imitation in my hand!

00:08:41.230 --> 00:08:44.970
This card lets me choose up to two 
Ancient Gears in my graveyard,

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:48.160
and Special Summon them, with their 
monster effects negated.

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:49.870
I choose to restore...

00:08:50.370 --> 00:08:53.910
...the Double Ancient Gear Hunting Hound and

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:56.250
Ancient Gear Hunting Hound in my graveyard!

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:05.290
I attack you directly with 
the three monsters!

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:07.360
Yuya?

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:11.560
Attacking Yuya, who hasn't 
even had a turn yet...

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:12.800
That's dirty!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:16.670
And the total damage dealt by 
the three monsters is 4200?

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:20.770
Yuya doesn't have a monster. 
He can't possibly stop it.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:23.610
First, Ancient Gear Hunting Hound...

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:24.840
Get him!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:41.330
Y-Yuya!

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:43.290
I'm right here!

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.550
Yuya...

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:48.750
I used Action Spell Big Escape.

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:51.470
Its effect forced an end to the battle!

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:52.910
Big Escape...

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:57.080
That's the Action Card he used in 
his entertainment duel with me.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:00.220
See? Yuya really is enchanting.

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:01.850
Should you really be happy?

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:05.360
I thought we'd have finished one of them,

00:10:05.360 --> 00:10:07.320
but my calculations were wrong again!

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:09.790
I end my turn.

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:18.290
Yuya, even if they are the Obelisk Force...

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:22.480
As you are now, I think you can use your 
duel to communicate with them.

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:23.420
Ute...

00:10:25.970 --> 00:10:28.840
I'll watch your fight.

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:30.040
Okay...

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:33.340
I'll show you my ultimate entertainment duel!

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:34.310
My turn!

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:37.760
I set the Pendulum Scale with 
Scale 1 Stargazer Magician

00:10:37.760 --> 00:10:42.330
and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:52.930
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 2 and 7 simultaneously.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.900
Swing, my soul's pendulum.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:58.500
Draw a shining arc in the sky!

00:10:58.870 --> 00:11:00.740
Pendulum Summon!

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:03.590
Appear, my monsters!

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.210
First, Performapal Friendonkey.

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:11.080
Then, Performapal Silver Claw.

00:11:11.750 --> 00:11:14.000
And last on the stage,

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.750
the heroic one with beautiful, 
different-colored eyes,

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:19.090
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.060
The fun

00:11:21.810 --> 00:11:23.350
is only getting started!

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:29.700
The fun

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:31.800
is only getting started!

00:11:31.800 --> 00:11:34.910
Now, show me the ultimate duel.

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:39.040
It's a bit early, but I'm going to repay 
you for what you did to me.

00:11:39.320 --> 00:11:45.020
Performapal Silver Claw attacks Triple 
Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:48.510
In that instant, Silver Claw's effect

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:53.460
increases all Performapals' attack points 
by 300 until the Battle Phase ends.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:05.270
Next, Performapal Friendonkey attacks 
Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:12:14.180 --> 00:12:17.120
Last, Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:20.280
attacks Double Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:22.890
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:26.220
Odd-Eyes's effect...

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:30.730
When it does battle with a monster, of Level 
5 or above, battle damage is doubled.

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:32.660
Reaction Force!

00:12:37.100 --> 00:12:38.120
Yes!

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:39.340
He did it!

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:42.440
He Pendulum Summoned three monsters,

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:47.280
and with consecutive attacks, he destroyed 
all monsters on the opponent fields.

00:12:47.630 --> 00:12:49.340
Perfect.

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:50.480
Yuya...

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:53.580
I now end my turn.

00:12:53.900 --> 00:12:55.820
Oh? Is that all?

00:12:55.820 --> 00:13:02.080
I was wondering what kind of 
duel the Lancers might fight

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:05.360
to require both the Tyler 
sisters and us, as well.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:07.300
But I didn't expect you to be so soft.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.430
Soft?

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.280
Yes, you're pathetic!

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:14.540
If you'd attacked me three times directly, 
you could have cut down

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.130
one of your opponents.

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:20.210
That would be doing the 
same thing he tried to do.

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:23.240
I don't only want to finish this.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:24.960
I want to communicate with my duel!

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:26.090
Communicate?

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:30.330
Yeah. I think a duel can open a 
person's heart, so you can talk.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.720
That includes you guys.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:34.680
Our mission is to destroy the Lancers!

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:37.090
We have no time for talk.

00:13:37.090 --> 00:13:42.240
Exactly. They are already 5 minutes, 
32 seconds past my calculations.

00:13:42.240 --> 00:13:44.100
They have no time to waste.

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:46.340
Well, it's your turn.

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:48.310
You don't have to remind me!

00:13:48.960 --> 00:13:52.540
I summon Ancient Gear Hunting 
Hound from my hand!

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:59.520
When my opponent has monsters 
on his side of the field,

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:03.480
then once per turn, I deal 
600 damage to you.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:04.860
Hound Flame!

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:09.240
I activate my Counter Trap 
Raidraptor — Silent Roar!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:12.060
When there's a Raidraptor on my field,

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:14.970
I negate effect damage that 
my opponent activates.

00:14:18.310 --> 00:14:19.570
Thanks, Kurosaki!

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:26.240
Then, I activate Ancient Gear 
Scrap Fusion from my hand!

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:28.410
I use Ancient Gear monsters 
in my graveyard

00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:32.550
as components to Fusion Summon 
a monster, with its effect negated.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:34.490
I choose...

00:14:34.490 --> 00:14:38.440
From my graveyard, Triple Ancient 
Gear Hunting Hound...

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:41.360
...and Ancient Gear Hunting Hound, from mine!

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:44.090
Using these two cards, I Fusion Summon!

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:51.430
Join the battle, Level 9 Ultimate 
Ancient Gear Hunting Hound!

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:58.000
Then, I activate my spell card Ancient Gear 
Double Imitation from my hand.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:01.880
Targeting the Double Ancient Gear 
Hunting Hound in my graveyard...

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:05.950
...and the Triple Ancient Gear 
Hunting Hound in mine.

00:15:05.950 --> 00:15:09.320
To Special Summon them, 
with monster effects negated!

00:15:14.260 --> 00:15:18.380
And I activate Ancient Gear 
Hunting Hound's effect!

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:21.260
When there are Ancient Gears on my field,

00:15:21.260 --> 00:15:24.100
I can Fusion Summon without Polymerization.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:28.780
Mechanical hunting dogs, 
inheriting the souls of antiquity,

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:34.080
bring your ten heads together and 
achieve the power of chaos!

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.550
Fusion Summon!

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.410
Appear, Level 10...

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:43.640
Power that turns the world to formless chaos.

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:47.180
...Chaos Ancient Gear Giant!

00:15:49.410 --> 00:15:51.130
I-It's huge!

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:52.420
Insurmountable.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:10.070
No!

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:15.990
Sayaka!

00:16:20.150 --> 00:16:21.260
Syun!

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:28.200
Summoning that thing, is he 
trying to endanger us, too?

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:33.640
Syun...

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.480
Syun! Sayaka!

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:43.160
I'm glad you're safe.

00:16:44.710 --> 00:16:46.020
Syun...

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:57.160
Syun!

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.810
Syun! Syun!

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:06.840
No way.

00:17:07.970 --> 00:17:08.940
Battle!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:16.510
Chaos Ancient Gear Giant attacks 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:26.160
During the Battle Phase,

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:30.230
Chaos Ancient Gear Giant can attack every 
monster on your side of the field.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.950
Next, I attack Silver Claw!

00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:40.080
I send Performapal Inflater Tapir 
from my hand to my graveyard,

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.840
to reduce damage in this battle to 0!

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:54.400
Don't relax just yet.

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:57.070
You have only 2000 life remaining.

00:17:57.070 --> 00:17:59.560
When the 4500-attack-point Chaos Giant

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:02.060
attacks the 1600-point Friendonkey...

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:03.760
...it will all be over!

00:18:04.030 --> 00:18:06.840
Do it, Chaos Ancient Gear Giant.

00:18:06.840 --> 00:18:09.700
Attack Performapal Friendonkey!

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:24.510
I activate Action Spell Quick Guard!

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:28.420
I switch Friendonkey to defense position.

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:34.990
Friendonkey is destroyed, 
but no damage is dealt.

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:37.420
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:38.900
Kaito!

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:42.780
That's the wanted man Kaito?

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:44.940
He's working with the Lancers?

00:18:44.940 --> 00:18:47.020
Foolish interference...

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.040
I now end my turn!

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.380
Leave this to me.

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:52.620
My turn!

00:18:52.620 --> 00:18:54.380
I summon Cipher Wing!

00:18:57.130 --> 00:18:58.850
You're helping us, Kaito?

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:01.910
Worry about your ally, not me!

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:06.400
When there's a Cipher Wing 
on my side of the field,

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:09.630
I can Special Summon another 
Cipher Wing from my hand.

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:18.420
I tribute one Cipher Wing to increase 
the level of the other two by 4.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:23.560
And I overlay my two Level 8 Cipher Wings!

00:19:27.570 --> 00:19:29.510
Galaxy shining in the darkness...

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:34.450
Dwell within the god of vengeance 
and become my servant!

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:35.920
Xyz Summon!

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:41.630
Descend, Rank 8 Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon!

00:19:44.190 --> 00:19:50.030
I use one of Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon's 
Overlay Units to activate its effect!

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:53.510
Cipher Projection!

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:59.980
I take control of Chaos Ancient Gear 
Giant until my End Phase,

00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:02.950
and treat it as a Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon.

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:05.220
My Chaos Giant...

00:20:07.730 --> 00:20:11.610
And I activate Continuous 
Spells Cipher Interference

00:20:11.610 --> 00:20:13.750
and Cipher Diffusion in my hand!

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:16.730
In exchange for reducing

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:22.220
the attack points of one Cipher monster 
on my field, with 3000 or more to 0,

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:25.840
Cipher Diffusion allows another Cipher 
monster to attack three times.

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:29.820
I reduce the attack points of 
one Cipher Dragon to 0,

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:32.860
and attack directly with my 
other Cipher Dragon!

00:20:34.050 --> 00:20:38.140
Even if you beat the other two, 
I still have 4000 life.

00:20:38.140 --> 00:20:40.320
Your monster with 3000 attack points can't...

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:43.280
When I have two or more 
Cipher monsters on my field,

00:20:43.280 --> 00:20:46.810
the effect of Continuous Spell 
Cipher Interference lets me

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:50.560
double the attack points of one during battle!

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.900
Double? 6000?

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:55.820
Are you ready to make your confession?!

00:20:57.100 --> 00:20:58.880
Go... Battle!

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:03.270
Galaxy-Eyes Cipher Dragon, attack all 
three members of the Obelisk Force!

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:06.480
Annihilating Cipher Stream!

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.420
W-Wait!

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:46.480
Looks like we're up again.

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:49.190
Kaito is interesting, as well.

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:52.160
But first, I want a rematch against Yuya.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:01.800
Wh-What is the meaning of this?

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:03.830
Let no one else interfere!

00:22:04.390 --> 00:22:07.070
Yusyo Sakaki's son...

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:10.210
I shall bury you myself.

00:23:50.260 --> 00:23:53.440
Yuya Sakaki, we'll settle things at last.

00:23:53.440 --> 00:23:56.640
How can I communicate 
with Edo in this duel?

00:23:56.640 --> 00:23:58.480
I'll beat you, no matter what.

00:23:58.780 --> 00:24:03.290
And I shall show you that Yusyo 
Sakaki's way of dueling is wrong!

00:24:03.290 --> 00:24:07.340
He's convinced that their 
way of dueling is right.

00:24:07.340 --> 00:24:09.750
Their way of dueling...

00:24:09.750 --> 00:24:10.960
That's it!

00:24:11.400 --> 00:24:15.330
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
Broken Smile World.

00:24:15.330 --> 00:24:17.670
The fun is only getting started!
